Create a modern, premium website for an interior design and home decor brand named **Kevion Decors**.

---

## 🎯 Main Goal

This website is a **premium digital showroom**:

* Showcase interior designs and decor items
* No checkout or payment system
* Customers will **contact via Instagram or WhatsApp (DM-based ordering)**

---

## 🎨 Brand Style & Theme

* Primary: Light Mint Green
* Secondary: Warm Gold
* Accent: Deep Emerald Green
* Background: Cream / Ivory
* Style: Minimal, elegant, airy, luxury
* Avoid heavy/dark black tones

---

## 🏠 Website Structure

### 1. Hero Section (Top Fold)

* Full-width **autoplay background video**
* Video should show luxury interiors & decor
* Must be: muted, loop, smooth

**Overlay Text:**
“Designing Spaces, Defining Lifestyles”

**Buttons:**

* View Collection
* DM on Instagram

---

### 2. Product / Design Showcase (MAIN SECTION)

Display all items in a **premium grid layout with dummy images (Unsplash/Pexels)**.

### Categories:

* Living Room Designs
* Bedroom Designs
* Kitchen Designs
* Decor Items
* **Cotton Decor Collection (Premium Decorative Focus)**

---

### Cotton Decor Collection (IMPORTANT 🔥)

This is NOT basic items. Focus on **aesthetic decorative cotton pieces**:

Include:

* Textured Cotton Wall Panels
* Designer Fabric Wall Art
* Cotton Decorative Drapes (layered & stylish)
* Upholstered Accent Decor Pieces
* Handmade Cotton Installations
* Fabric-Based Interior Decor Structures
* Artistic Cotton Backdrops

Each item should feel:

* Premium
* Stylish
* Modern
* Highly decorative (not utility-focused)

---

### Item Card Design (for all categories)

Each item must include:

* Image (dummy for now)
* Title
* Short premium description
* Optional price (₹ or “Starting from…”)
* Button: **Enquire Now**

👉 On click:

* Open WhatsApp OR Instagram DM
* Pre-filled message:
  “Hi, I’m interested in this design from Kevion Decors”

---

### 3. Video Showcase Section

* Add a **playable video section**
* Auto-preview + click to play
* Show luxury interiors

**Title:**
“Experience Our Designs”

---

### 4. About Section

* Short premium brand introduction
* Focus on elegance, creativity, and attention to detail

---

### 5. Why Choose Us

* Premium Quality
* Modern Elegant Designs
* Attention to Detail
* Affordable Luxury

---

### 6. Instagram Section (VERY IMPORTANT)

* Show **dummy Instagram feed preview (grid)**
* Button: “Follow on Instagram”
* This acts as a key conversion channel

---

### 7. Call to Action Section

Text:
“Like something? Let’s design it for you.”

Buttons:

* DM on Instagram
* Chat on WhatsApp

---

### 8. Contact Section

* Minimal form (optional)
* Focus on:

  * WhatsApp click-to-chat
  * Instagram profile link

---

### 9. Footer

* Logo
* Navigation links
* Social icons
* Tagline:
  “Designing Spaces, Defining Lifestyles”

---

## ⚙️ Functional Requirements

* Hero video must autoplay, muted, loop
* Add **dummy high-quality images everywhere initially**
* Add **playable video section**
* Add **floating WhatsApp button (bottom right)**
* Add Instagram link/button in header + sections

### WhatsApp Integration:

Use:
https://wa.me/<your-number>?text=Hi%20I’m%20interested%20in%20Kevion%20Decors

---

## ✨ UI/UX Requirements

* Clean, spacious layout (not cluttered)
* Smooth scroll animations
* Elegant fonts (serif or modern sans-serif)
* Soft shadows and hover effects
* Premium luxury feel (like high-end interior brands)

---

## 📌 Final Outcome

A **luxury, elegant, modern website** that:

* Feels like a high-end showroom
* Showcases designs beautifully
* Encourages users to **DM via Instagram/WhatsApp to order**

No cart, no payments — only **direct interaction sales model**.
